@startuml
title gDiagram — Rendering Pipeline

start

:Source text arrives
(DocumentView edit after the Debouncer,
LspServer didChange / renderSvg,
or headless CLI export);

:DiagramEngine.detect_format()
file extension (.puml / .mmd / .ged),
else TypeDetector.is_mermaid();

if (Format?) then (PlantUML)
    :DiagramEngine.preprocess()
    Preprocessor: includes (with markers),
    macros (define / procedure / function),
    conditionals (if / ifdef),
    style blocks → skinparam lines;
    note right
        Included text is wrapped in marker
        comment lines, so element line
        numbers still point into the main
        file (Preprocessor.source_line_numbers).
    end note
    :TypeDetector.detect_plantuml()
    the @start tag, then content keywords
    → one of 25 PlantUML types
    (deployment files → COMPONENT,
    WBS → MindMap parser);
    :Lexer → Tokens → TokenStream
    (or line-based parsing
    for data-style types);
    :Type-specific parser
    (Sequence = GDiagram.Parser,
    Activity = orchestrator + 7 sub-parsers)
    → typed AST + ParseErrors;
else (Mermaid)
    :TypeDetector.detect_mermaid()
    first keyword (flowchart, sequenceDiagram,
    gitGraph, C4Context, ...)
    → one of 23 Mermaid types;
    :MermaidLexer → MermaidTokens;
    :Mermaid<Type>Parser
    → typed AST + ParseErrors;
endif

if (Parse errors?) then (yes)
    :RenderResult PARSE_ERROR
    → editor error highlights;
    stop
else (no)
endif

:Renderer.generate_dot(ast)
PlantUML via GraphvizRenderer facade
(sequence, structural, behavioral,
specialized), Mermaid renderers direct —
reads Theme SkinParams + ThemeManager palette,
normalizes colors (#red → red);
note right
    DiagramEngine.parse() stops before
    this step: the LSP server reparses on
    every didChange and only needs the AST
    and ParseErrors — no Graphviz work.
    CLI -f dot writes this DOT and stops
    (DiagramEngine.generate_dot).
end note

if (Renderer?) then (most)
    :GraphvizCompat.render_data(ctx, graph, svg)
    C wrapper around patched libgvc
    (gvRenderData length: size_t, not unsigned int);
else (Activity)
    :RenderUtils.run_graphviz_subprocess()
    runs patched /usr/local/bin/dot -Tsvg
    (HTML TABLE text centering fix);
endif

:SVG post-processing
RenderUtils.draw_custom_markers() (class/component
arrow ends), RenderUtils.draw_actor_figures()
(sequence/use case actors),
ComponentDiagramRenderer.place_ports_on_border();

fork
    :render_to_surface()
    RenderUtils.svg_to_surface()
    librsvg → Cairo.ImageSurface;
    :RenderUtils.parse_svg_regions()
    → ElementRegion list (id, source line, bounds)
    → DiagramEngine.last_regions;
    :RenderResult OK
    (surface, AST, diagram type)
    → PreviewPane + outline + properties;
fork again
    :export_to_png()
    Cairo surface → PNG file;
fork again
    :export_to_svg()
    post-processed SVG → file;
fork again
    :export_to_pdf()
    RenderUtils.export_svg_to_pdf()
    librsvg → Cairo PDF surface;
end fork

stop

@enduml
